{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scooch, shoot, and scoot your way to the finish tile in <i>Single Scoop!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Single Scoop </i>is a fast paced action puzzle game where the goal is to go to the right! Movement requires precise timing, each block changes the pattern of the cursor's movement, and visiting new blocks builds your combo meter. Discover and take advantage of all the game\u2019s mechanics to reach the goal, all with just one button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash into this adventure featuring a vivid color palette, dazzling animations,  and adaptive music. Can you be the greatest singular scooper?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-hearted Arcade Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reflex based gameplay with just a single button!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucid Aesthetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Brilliant art style and fruit-based unlockable player decorations!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing Challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Low barrier of entry with a high skill ceiling!</i>\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631360?t=1753391287","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631360/4e7d711e90b05fd400d20040e0a19a841045f420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753391287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631360/7a56fb5328260c85850c444c3ce2a98edf85e771/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753391287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631360/7a56fb5328260c85850c444c3ce2a98edf85e771/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753391287","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28